        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eugene Levy, John Candy, Robert Loggia, Meg Ryan, Joe Seely, Noah Levenstein\n- Works: Armed and Dangerous, American Pie films, Tough Guys, Shag\n- Topics: film roles, film appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Armed and Dangerous is a 1986 American action-crime comedy film starring John Candy, Eugene Levy, Robert Loggia, and Meg Ryan.\n- Eugene Levy is the only actor to have appeared in all eight American Pie films.\n- Eugene Levy played the role of Noah Levenstein in all eight American Pie films.\n- Joe Seely's other films include Armed and Dangerous, Tough Guys, and Shag.",
